      \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/writing/\">\n            Writings\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/code/\">\n            Code\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/talking/\" aria-current=\"page\">\n            Talks\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n      <div class=\"page__main-foot\">\n        <main>\n          <div class=\"post\">\n  <div class=\"topic-header page-header\">\n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h1 id=\"content_heading\" class=\"post__header__title\">\n        Sometimes I speak\n      </h1>\n    </div>\n  </div> <!-- .page-header -->\n\n  <div class=\"tri\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <p>\n  I have things to say. Sometimes instead of writing those things down I open my mouth and words fall out. \n  Sometimes those words are swept up and saved in some manner so they can be consumed at a later point in time.  \n  Sometimes they're not.  Oh well.\n</p>\n\n\n<ul class=\"post-list\">\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hfn18nDkyi4\">Online Panel: “Accessibility is too hard” - Developer Edition</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-12-13\">2019.12.13</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Talk: The Accessibility of HTML @ a11yto -\n      <a href=\"https://scottaohara.github.io/talks_and_such/a11yTO-2019/\">slides</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-10-24\">2019.10.24</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://allevents.in/boston/getting-audited-the-consequences-of-delivering-inaccessible-code-and-design/1000065934352423\">Getting Audited: The Consequences of Delivering Inaccessible Code &amp; Design</a>, co-presented with <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ericwbailey\">Eric Bailey</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-08-23\">2019.08.23</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.paciellogroup.com/events/2019/06/webinar-july-11-accessibility-testing-tools-and-when-to-use-them/\">Accessibility Testing Tools and When to Use Them</a>, co-presented with <a href=\"https://twitter.com/poorgeek\">Justin Stockton</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-07-11\">2019.07.11</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"http://www.csun.edu/cod/conference/2019/sessions/index.php/public/presentations/view/1167\">Talk: Finding the Best Perfect</a> - <a href=\"https://scottaohara.github.io/talks_and_such/CSUN_2019/\">slides</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-03-13\">2019.03.13</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"http://www.csun.edu/cod/conference/2019/sessions/index.php/public/presentations/view/1160\">Panel: Role-Based Challenges of Implementing Accessibility Remediation</a>\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2019-03-13\">2019.03.13</time>.\n      Panel presented by\n      <a href=\"https://twitter.com/poorgeek\">Justin Stockton</a>,\n      featuring myself,\n      <a href=\"https://twitter.com/handcoding\">Ashley Bischoff</a>\n      and\n      <a href=\"https://twitter.com/JohnSweetA11y\">John Sweet</a>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/Boston-CSS/events/247735242/\">\n      Talk: UX Equality @ Boston CSS Meetup</a>\n    </p>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tvXDvE6r5w4\">Recorded but lacks (meaningful) audio</a></p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2018-02-22\">2018.02.22</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <a href=\"https://youtu.be/7t6r00Kbu-0\" class=\"txt-up-1\" title=\"on youtube\">\n      Panel: All Things A11Y\n    </a>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Posted:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2017-11-29\">2017.11.29</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=byh6G3vViWM\" class=\"txt-up-1\" title=\"on youtube\">\n      Talk: Accessibility: Where to start?\n    </a>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Posted:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2017-09-20\">2017.09.20</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <a href=\"https://www.freshtilledsoil.com/the-dirt-accessibility-with-marla-runyan-of-perkins-school-for-the-blind/\" class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Podcast: Accessibility with Marla Runyan of Perkins School for the Blind\n    </a>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Posted:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2017-05-18\">2017.05.18</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>I did some teaching</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Lecture: Best Practices: HTML &amp; CSS @ Resilient Coders\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2016-07-17\">2016.07.17</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Lecture: Intro to HTML &amp; CSS best practices @ StartUp Institute\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2015-03-13\">2015.03.13</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Lecture: Intro to HTML &amp; CSS best practices @ StartUp Institute\n    </p>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2014-10-27\">2014.10.27</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <a href=\"https://generalassemb.ly/instructors/scott-o-hara/2530\" class=\"txt-up-1\">\n      Sassy CSS: An Intro to Sass @ General Assembly\n    </a>\n    <small class=\"display-block\">\n      <span class=\"txt-bold\">Presented:</span>\n      <time datetime=\"2015-03-12\">2015.03.12</time>,\n      <time datetime=\"2014-09-26\">2014.09.26</time>, and\n      <time datetime=\"2014-06-12\">2014.06.12</time>\n    </small>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          <div class=\"txt-right\">\n            <a href=\"#page_banner\" class=\"back-to-top\">Back to top</a>\n          </div>\n        </main>\n        <footer id=\"page_footer\" class=\"page__footer\">\n  <ul class=\"list-clean list-horizontal has-pipes\">\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"/about\">About Me</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara\" rel=\"me\" aria-label=\" GitHub: scottaohara\">\n  <span class=\"icon icon--github\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path fill=\"#828282\" d=\"M7.999,0.431c-4.285,0-7.76,3.474-7.76,7.761 c0,3.428,2.223,6.337,5.307,7.363c0.388,0.071,0.53-0.168,0.53-0.374c0-0.184-0.007-0.672-0.01-1.32 c-2.159,0.469-2.614-1.04-2.614-1.04c-0.353-0.896-0.862-1.135-0.862-1.135c-0.705-0.481,0.053-0.472,0.053-0.472 c0.779,0.055,1.189,0.8,1.189,0.8c0.692,1.186,1.816,0.843,2.258,0.645c0.071-0.502,0.271-0.843,0.493-1.037 C4.86,11.425,3.049,10.76,3.049,7.786c0-0.847,0.302-1.54,0.799-2.082C3.7